      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I found a workaround in-client. Step 1. Take a new photo, 2. Set it as the profile picture, 3. Then delete it.\n\nAnd there isn't a way to reset it on the website right now. I'm not sure, but maybe we had some updates.",
