  "details": "1.) Open VRChat.com\n\n2.) Log in on an account with a VRC+ subscription\n\n3.) Click your profile picture to open your profile.\n\n4.) Click the pencil to edit your profile.\n\n5.) Click your profile picture\n\n6.) Set a custom image or upload a new one.\n\n7.) Click Confirm\n\n8.) Observe there is no UI to unset the picture and revert to no custom image (simply shown currently worn avatar)",
